                <pb facs="0138" n="20" sameAs="frus:frus1929v03/pg20"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Annex II]</seg></opener>
                <p>[This annex is not printed. It is the same as annex I-a, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >supra</hi>, except for slight verbal changes and the omission of the two
                    last <pb facs="0139" n="21" xml:id="pg21"/> paragraphs preceding the final
                    paragraph. For annex II as amended, see the joint statement of President Hoover
                    and the British Prime Minister set forth in the statement issued to the press
                    October 10, printed on <ref target="#pg33">page 33</ref>.]</p>
            </div>
